  "311-feedback-loop": "<div class=\"kick\">Public sector \u00b7 311</div><h1 style=\"font-size:62px\">Closed is not the same as <em>resolved</em></h1><div style=\"margin-top:36px;background:#fff;border-radius:28px;padding:26px 26px 20px;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.25)\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;background:#F4F7FF;border:2px solid #DCE4F7;border-radius:18px;padding:14px 22px\"><div style=\"flex:none;min-width:58px;height:58px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:29px;background:#0C184A;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:28px\">1</div><div><div style=\"font-size:31px;font-weight:800;color:#0C184A\">Request closes</div><div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:#5E6B98;margin-top:2px\">The 311 case moves to closed</div></div></div><div style=\"width:0;height:0;margin:7px auto;border-left:13px solid transparent;border-right:13px solid transparent;border-top:15px solid #1E54E8\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;background:#F4F7FF;border:2px solid #DCE4F7;border-radius:18px;padding:14px 22px\"><div style=\"flex:none;min-width:58px;height:58px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:29px;background:#0C184A;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:28px\">2</div><div><div style=\"font-size:31px;font-weight:800;color:#0C184A\">Survey sends once</div><div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:#5E6B98;margin-top:2px\">To the resident who asked</div></div></div><div style=\"width:0;height:0;margin:7px auto;border-left:13px solid transparent;border-right:13px solid transparent;border-top:15px solid #1E54E8\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;background:#F4F7FF;border:2px solid #DCE4F7;border-radius:18px;padding:14px 22px\"><div style=\"flex:none;min-width:58px;height:58px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:29px;background:#0C184A;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:28px\">3</div><div><div style=\"font-size:31px;font-weight:800;color:#0C184A\">They answer</div><div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:#5E6B98;margin-top:2px\">\u201cWas your request resolved?\u201d</div></div></div><div style=\"width:0;height:0;margin:7px auto;border-left:13px solid transparent;border-right:13px solid transparent;border-top:15px solid #1E54E8\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;background:#F4F7FF;border:2px solid #DCE4F7;border-radius:18px;padding:14px 22px\"><div style=\"flex:none;min-width:58px;height:58px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:29px;background:#0C184A;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:28px\">4</div><div><div style=\"font-size:31px;font-weight:800;color:#0C184A\">Saved on the case</div><div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:#5E6B98;margin-top:2px\">By service type and district</div></div></div><div style=\"width:0;height:0;margin:7px auto;border-left:13px solid transparent;border-right:13px solid transparent;border-top:15px solid #1E54E8\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;background:#EAF1FF;border:3px solid #1E54E8;border-radius:18px;padding:14px 22px\"><div style=\"flex:none;min-width:58px;height:58px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:29px;background:#1E54E8;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:28px\">5</div><div><div style=\"font-size:31px;font-weight:800;color:#0C184A\">A \u201cno\u201d gets an owner</div><div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:#5E6B98;margin-top:2px\">Follow-up case to the department</div></div></div></div><div class=\"foot\"><div class=\"url\">npssurveys.com/insights</div><div class=\"fine\">State &amp; local: Carahsoft CoreTrust 24COR-018GR. No government endorsement implied.</div></div>",
